{"at": "2026-10-04T14:26:39.312596+00:00", "event_id": "01M43MYJJGE865APXNFZPXSSCN", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M43MY6EX66Y6Z68C9NRCKHWH", "final_answer": "Operator brief (dispatch prompt, 2026-10-04): #5663 verify-or-fix, and per grounding it is already fixed by #5659 (pinned by test_action_implement_records_claim_base_and_reaches_review), so close it as a duplicate with that evidence and add no new code. #5680 is fixed red-first through both claim verbs, with paired controls (finished occupant passes, live occupant refuses, same-WP resume allowed). Non-goals: no weakening for live missions; no editing another mission's status log; no new gates.", "mission_id": "01M43MVY8TPQYNA0S9SF057V4C", "mission_slug": "single-branch-claim-gaps-01M43MVY", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-10-04T14:26:39.312596Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M43MY6EX66Y6Z68C9NRCKHWH", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-04T14:26:39.307775Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
{"at": "2026-10-04T14:26:42.329500+00:00", "event_id": "01M43MYNGSQRZZ0ESFN2XJP6QB", "event_type": "DecisionPointResolved", "payload": {"actual_participants": [], "closed_locally_while_widened": false, "closure_message": null, "decision_point_id": "01M43MY9BKY2BBJQN4D2GVM436", "final_answer": "Branch-scoped liveness: a WP occupies the write checkout only when its mission's write branch (mission_runtime.single_branch_write_ref over meta.json) is the branch the checkout is on, in addition to the existing is_mission_completed filter. Rationale: a single_branch mission's authoritative status surface is its write branch, so a status copy read on another branch is not live. The operator brief delegates the final choice to plan, where it is recorded with its authority.", "mission_id": "01M43MVY8TPQYNA0S9SF057V4C", "mission_slug": "single-branch-claim-gaps-01M43MVY", "mission_type": "software-dev", "origin_surface": "planning_interview", "other_answer": false, "rationale": null, "recorded_at": "2026-10-04T14:26:42.329500Z", "resolved_by": "cli", "run_id": "01M43MY9BKY2BBJQN4D2GVM436", "state_entered_at": "2026-10-04T14:26:42.323562Z", "summary": null, "terminal_outcome": "resolved"}}
